  <main class="content">
    <h1>Resources</h1>
    <p><b>NorSand Resources</b> brings together key publications, books, software documentation, benchmark examples, webinars, and open code and data related to critical state soil mechanics and the NorSand constitutive model. Resources are organized to support users from the fundamental concepts of critical state and state parameter through model formulation, calibration, implementation, and applications.</p>

    <!-- ============================ Start Here ============================ -->
    <section class="resource-panel" id="start-here" role="tabpanel">
      <div class="resource-section">
        <h2 class="resource-section__title">A reading path through NorSand</h2>
        <p class="resource-section__desc">The Research Library follows the intellectual development of the model. Each step builds on the one before it.</p>
        <ol class="reading-path">
          <li><a href="#critical-state-foundations">Critical State Foundations</a><span>The Cambridge framework from which NorSand develops.</span></li>
          <li><a href="#state-parameter">State Parameter and Critical State of Sands</a><span>Why density alone is not enough: the state parameter ψ.</span></li>
          <li><a href="#norsand-development">NorSand Development</a><span>The original formulation and its generalisation to 3D, calibration and cyclic loading.</span></li>
          <li><a href="#implementation-verification">Implementation and Verification</a><span>From triaxial equations to general 3D numerical implementations.</span></li>
          <li><a href="#applications">Applications and Recent Research</a><span>Datasets, calibration methods and engineering applications.</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="resource-section">
        <h2 class="resource-section__title">Featured resources</h2>
        <div class="resource-grid">

          <article class="resource-card resource-card--featured">
            <p class="resource-card__eyebrow">Key paper &middot; State parameter</p>
            <p class="resource-card__title"><a href="https://doi.org/10.1680/geot.1985.35.2.99" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Been &amp; Jefferies (1985), "A state parameter for sands"</a> <span class="arrow">&#8599;</span></p>
            <p class="resource-card__domain">Géotechnique 35(2), 99–112</p>
            <p class="resource-card__desc">Introduces the state parameter ψ, combining void ratio and stress level relative to the critical state line into a single measure of sand behaviour.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="resource-card resource-card--featured">
            <p class="resource-card__eyebrow">Key paper &middot; Original model</p>
            <p class="resource-card__title"><a href="https://doi.org/10.1680/geot.1993.43.1.91" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Jefferies (1993), "Nor-Sand: a simple critical state model for sand"</a> <span class="arrow">&#8599;</span></p>
            <p class="resource-card__domain">Géotechnique 43(1), 91–103</p>
            <p class="resource-card__desc">The original NorSand formulation: a Cambridge-type model for sand in which hardening is tied to the state parameter rather than to void ratio alone.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="resource-card resource-card--featured">
            <p class="resource-card__eyebrow">Book &middot; Reference text</p>
            <p class="resource-card__title"><a href="https://doi.org/10.1201/b19114" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Jefferies &amp; Been (2015), Soil Liquefaction: A Critical State Approach, 2nd ed.</a> <span class="arrow">&#8599;</span></p>
            <p class="resource-card__domain">CRC Press</p>
            <p class="resource-card__desc">The comprehensive reference on the state parameter approach and NorSand, from theory through laboratory testing, in-situ characterisation and engineering practice.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="resource-card resource-card--featured">
            <p class="resource-card__eyebrow">Software documentation</p>
            <p class="resource-card__title"><a href="https://docs.itascacg.com/itasca950/common/models/norsand/doc/modelnorsand.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Itasca: NorSand Model documentation</a> <span class="arrow">&#8599;</span></p>
            <p class="resource-card__domain">docs.itascacg.com &middot; FLAC3D / FLAC2D</p>
            <p class="resource-card__desc">Model equations, properties and references, with examples including an undrained triaxial test and tailings-dam static liquefaction.</p>
          </article>
