      <!-- 5. Applications -->
      <div class="path-step" id="applications">
        <h2 class="resource-section__title path-step__title"><span class="path-step__num">05</span> Applications and Recent Research</h2>
        <p class="resource-section__desc">A selective, growing list. Entries are added as they are reviewed.</p>
        <ul class="cite-list">
          <li class="cite-row" id="norsand4ai">
            <p class="cite-row__ref">Ozelim, L.C.S.M., Casagrande, M.D.T. &amp; Cavalcante, A.L.B. (2024). <span class="cite-row__title">NorSand4AI: a comprehensive triaxial test simulation database for NorSand constitutive model materials.</span> <span class="cite-row__venue">Geoscientific Model Development</span>, 17, 3175–3197.</p>
            <p class="cite-row__desc">Presents large synthetic datasets of simulated drained and undrained NorSand triaxial tests for machine-learning and benchmarking use.</p>
            <p class="cite-row__links"><a href="https://doi.org/10.5194/gmd-17-3175-2024" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a> <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8170536" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Dataset</a> <span class="badge badge--open">Open access &middot; CC BY 4.0</span> <span class="access-note">Access status may change.</span></p>
          </li>
          <li class="cite-row" id="numge2023">
            <p class="cite-row__ref">Castillo Fuentes, E., Zdravković, L. &amp; Potts, D.M. (2023). <span class="cite-row__title">On the calibration and application of the NorSand model.</span> <span class="cite-row__venue">10th European Conference on Numerical Methods in Geotechnical Engineering (NUMGE 2023)</span>.</p>
